{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700140/extras/bed184e4ad098c107b2474647f23c977.avif?t=1757702037\" width=900 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a final bid to cheat death, you challenge The\u00a0Alleyman\u00a0to a high-stakes dice game where every roll could be your last.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though the game is simple... what The Alleyman offers isn\u2019t: more time. Beat him, and attain extra life\u2014lose, and he takes what time you have left.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you?\u00a0You\u2019re\u00a0dying anyway, frail body ravaged by an incurable disease.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A single die. A single choice:\u00a0Will you take the deal?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700140/extras/f9ee6a4bde85a56d48ad608b07907ca3.avif?t=1757702037\" width=900 height=47 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u231b\u00a0GAME FEATURES\u00a0\u231b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>PIG: The Game</i> was made for the O2A2 VN Jam 2025, a micro Visual Novel Jam with strict asset limitations and a 1000 word limit.\u00a0\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 core conclusions.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 1,000 words.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original illustrations.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Alleyman plays against you.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PIG contains mature themes and is intended for an older audience. Player discretion is advised for visual and written descriptions of gambling, death, and disease.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name